 "remarks": "Bright, end-unit living in a secure gated community at 71 Strawberry Hill. This beautiful two-bedroom, one-bath residence offers a spacious, light-filled layout with a private balcony and open views toward downtown. Enjoy the convenience of one reserved parking space, in-building laundry, and well-maintained amenities including an in-ground pool, fitness center, and playground. Ideally located just steps from downtown dining, shopping, nightlife, and public transportation-perfect for easy everyday living or commuting. A move-in ready opportunity combining comfort, convenience, and lifestyle.",
